35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The roster books show the late-turn pool is nearly empty. We cannot extend hours.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The old pilots worked, but the accessibility records show some work was undone.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The committee minutes show the ferry and rail never agreed on data terms.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The ledger shows the construction balance is ring-fenced, but operating funds are low.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The audits show waiting for connections is the biggest time sink, not ticketing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, if the data terms aren't agreed, how do we integrate fares?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, if waiting is the issue, does the bus corridor help with connections?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the pre-war shells have high contingency pricing. Station upgrades are risky.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Takumi, the pilots met cost recovery, but that was eight years ago.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, the ticketing fees are high, but the audits say queues are short.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"The crew establishment is low, but the lift maintenance contract has spare capacity.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The lane-priority stretches were returned to mixed traffic. That worries me.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The roadway consents are delegated, but the data terms are not.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The paving rates are climbing, which makes the bus corridor expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"The mid-city runs are slower, but the crowds clear at the old rate.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning towards the station upgrades because the maintenance crew is available.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I am hesitant about the bus corridor because of the past lane issues.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the station upgrades due to the pre-war shell risks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the cost of the bus corridor given the paving rates.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I think the fare platform might be best if we can fix the data terms.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
